     LECH OS: no eSIM support for now (task E2-11b). The eSIM apps of Google are left out of the vendor module
     (patches/vendor/adevtool/0004) - they contacted lpa.live.esimdiscovery.com (Google) and lpa.ds.gsma.com at
     every start. Without them the device must not announce eSIM support, so Settings and telephony do not look
     for a missing eSIM manager. The physical SIM is not affected.
-->
<config>
    <unavailable-feature name="android.hardware.telephony.euicc" />
    <unavailable-feature name="android.hardware.telephony.euicc.mep" />
</config>
